  "description": "Server-authoritative combat resolution for SetNet, built on SetNet.Stats: turn an attacker's and defender's StatSets into a DamageResult (attack power, armor mitigation, crit) via a pluggable ICombatFormula, then apply it to a Health pool. Which stats mean \"attack power\"/\"defense\"/\"crit\" is fully configurable (CombatStatKeys), so it fits any stat vocabulary. No wire protocol. Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Stats.",
